{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月6日，澳大利亞墨爾本一名中國籍熊貓外賣騎手遭人襲擊後死亡，另一名騎手受傷，事件引發關注。維多利亞州警方於11月7日更新案情稱，事發時，兩名外賣騎手發現一名陌生男子正在破壞他們的自行車，隨後三方發生肢體衝突。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585726.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.127397+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T06:23:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"f9deb1f3959614029a4052b6daeab49acdbd71d9817da295759ae5edb0ecd1e8","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}